  "title": "Magic Knight Rayearth",
  "justification": "Checked by episode title against TVDB series 71634 and TMDB show 34158. AniDB episode 1-20 (\"伝説のマジックナイト始動\" (The Birth of the Legendary Magic Knights) to \"伝説の魔法騎士! 驚異の真実\" (The Unbelievable Truth about the Legendary Magic Knights)) are TVDB S1E1 \"The Birth of the Legendary Magic Knights\" to TVDB S1E20 \"The Unbelievable Truth About the Legendary Magic Knights\"; AniDB episode 21-49 (\"出発と新たな絆\" (A Departure and New Ties) to \"勝利への道! 信じる心が開く明日!\" (The Path to Victory! A Tomorrow that a Believing Heart Opens!)) are TVDB S2E1 \"A Departure and New Ties\" to TVDB S2E29 \"The Road to Victory: The Tomorrow that the Believing Heart Opens!\"; AniDB S1-S3 (\"Omake 1\" to \"Omake 3\") have no TVDB episode (their defaults are other items) and no TMDB episode (their defaults are other items); AniDB S4 \"Omake 4\" has no TVDB episode (its default TVDB S0E4 is \"Magic Knight Rayearth Pilot\", another item) and no TMDB episode (TMDB has no S0E4); AniDB S5 \"Omake 5\" has no TMDB episode (TMDB has no S0E5). AniDB S1-S5 are one-minute Omake shorts. The Anime-Lists row sent them to TVDB S0E5 and S0E6, two 25-minute opening and closing theme items, and to S0E7 and S0E8, which TVDB does not have; TMDB S0E1-E3 are the Rayearth OVA chapters of node 423.",
